Package: gcstflow
Title: Geodesic Transition CST Classification Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Pawel",
           family = "Gajer",
           email = "pgajer@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Pawel Gajer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Pawel Gajer <pgajer@gmail.com>
Description: Tools for building, validating, and visualizing geodesic
    transition Community State Type classifiers (gCSTs) on microbiome taxon
    graphs. The package provides methods for defining transition corridors
    between canonical CST cores, computing arm-centric similarity scores,
    and assigning soft or hard gCST labels with uncertainty diagnostics.
